The GameShell's orange LED is the AXP223's CHGLED pin. Its reset state leaves
the pin to REG32H[5:4] (tri-stated), so it stays dark while charging; the
board's own U-Boot handed it to the charger (REG32H bit 3), as this does.
--- a/drivers/power/axp221.c
+++ b/drivers/power/axp221.c
@@ -233,6 +233,11 @@ int axp_init(void)
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
+	/* the charge LED (CHGLED) driven by the charger, not left tri-stated */
+	ret = pmic_bus_setbits(0x32, 0x08);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
